{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Define your own provider for accordion component tokens","    \/\/ by inheriting from existing provider","    class CustomAccordionComponentTokensProvider: OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider {","","        \/\/ Then override the accordion component tokens you want.","","        override var spacePaddingBlockBottomExpandContainerDefault: SpaceSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._100 }","","        \/\/ ...","    }","","    \/\/ Or define your own provider from scratch","    class CustomAccordionComponentTokensProvider: AllAccordionComponentTokens {","","        \/\/ And implement hundreds of tokens.","        \/\/ You are allowed to give semantic tokens providers if you want to define values.","    }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, you can give this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomAccordionComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" to your own theme implementation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class LocalTheme: OrangeTheme {","","    override init() {","        super.init(accordion: CustomAccordionComponentTokensProvider())","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"or to an already existing theme for example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    OrangeTheme(accordion: CustomAccordionComponentTokensProvider())"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is also possible to use your own semantic tokens providers for this component tokens providers:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Uses by default here:","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider for sizes","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider for spaces","    let accordionComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider()","","    \/\/ Or use your own semantic tokens providers","    let accordionComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider(","                    sizes: CustomSizeSemanticTokensProvider(),","                    spaces: CustomSpaceSemanticTokensProvider())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of accordions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"accordions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllAccordionComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AccordionComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AccordionFaqComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"accordions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accordions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/init(sizes:spaces:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/spaces"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/AccordionComponentTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/AccordionFaqComponentTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Impl